+## Free-shipping fix (commit 77fbd16), awaiting verdict
+
+- Verdict: none yet. Submitted for approval, not released.
+- Awaiting: Dana Okafor <dana.okafor@lanternlane.example> (approver), away until Monday.
+- What: orders whose items come to 50.00 € or more, quantities included, ship free. Before, exactly 50.00 € was charged shipping and quantities were ignored.
